# The thing is… in Russian: дело в том, что; о том, чтобы
subtitle: "Дело в том, что…; думать о том, чтобы; зависит от того, где: how Russian puts то in the case its verb needs before a clause — as Tom tells Ольга his big idea."
tags: ["russian","дело в том что","то что","russian conjunctions","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/correlatives","grammar/verb-cases","vocabulary/work"]
thumb: "band \"The thing is… in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"In spite of the fact that in Russian: несмотря на то что, в связи с тем что","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/198-russian-in-spite-of.cast"}

## The thing is… in Russian: дело в том, что; о том, чтобы
